      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AMRON TOY (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide box before lifting strongly to score (37.71) at Bendigo in a Special conditions race over 660m. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Well placed and will be tough to beat. MEPUNGA DONNA (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at this track following on from a third place finish (42.30) there the start prior. Likely to play a prominent role. HURRICANE (5) recorded two placings in a row before an overdue win last time, scoring by 3 lengths (33.91) at this track. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Form should stack up. IN MODERATION (6) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
